; D7-exec runtime failure: the manifest binds `(big n)` to
; `:impl "wasm:huge"`. Plugin returns a frame whose header advertises
; ~4 GiB of payload that doesn't exist; hosts reject the oversized
; report (spec §9.3 cap) and the Zig invoker surfaces
; `plugin_func_alloc_failed` at the call span. Skipped on Zig-native +
; TS-parity (no wasm runtime).
(use-plugin "double")

(big 1)
